## 12. Reporting a problem

If you still cannot get the project working, report the issue with the following information:

- Which shortcut you were running.
- Which action failed.
- The exact error message.
- Whether the `Start` shortcut worked.
- Whether the QR code was retrieved successfully.
- Whether WalletWallet received the update request.
- Whether manual refresh works.
- Whether automatic refresh works.

Do not include your password, PIN, API key, access token or full QR code.

If the issue is related to a change in PureGym or WalletWallet, include the date when the problem first appeared.

